WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.460
Confidentiality focuses on protecting information designated as confidential.

2
00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:13.480
Organizations may handle proprietary information, customer records, business data, intellectual property, or regulated information.

3
00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:24.880
Access controls, secure storage, encryption, data classification, retention practices, and secure handling procedures help support confidentiality objectives.

4
00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:31.400
Confidentiality depends on knowing what information needs protection and who should have access to it.

5
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.060
Without classification and ownership, teams may not know which safeguards are appropriate.

6
00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:47.300
In daily operations, confidentiality is supported by least privilege, secure sharing practices, careful logging, vendor review, and thoughtful data lifecycle management.
